  {
   "services": ["pxi:mc"],
   "page": "Mode_Control_Services_PXI",
   "section": "\"pxi:mc\" service",
   "url": "https://www.3dbrew.org/wiki/Mode_Control_Services_PXI",
   "commandes": [
    {"h": "0x00010000", "n": "ShutdownPxi", "url": "https://www.3dbrew.org/wiki/Mode_Control_Services_PXI#\"pxi:mc\"_service", "note": "ShutdownPxi. This is sent to the ARM9 by the ARM11 PXI-module, when PXI-module is shutting down due to receiving srv notification-ID 0x100. This sets CFG_BOOTENV to the value for CTR (0x1), and is only time it's set by Process9.", "depuis": "1.0.0-0"},
    {"h": "0x00050040", "n": "Sleep", "url": "https://www.3dbrew.org/wiki/Mode_Control_Services_PXI#\"pxi:mc\"_service", "note": "Sleep (bool sleep). Used by PTM module. When seeing this command with a non-zero argument PXI module will block all other communication with Process9. This makes Process9 call svcKernelSetState(2), which will make Kernel9 synchronize with the Arm11's own KernelSetState(2) code and wait for a PXI_SYNC interrupt (sleep exit command).", "depuis": "1.0.0-0"},
    {"h": "0x00070000", "n": "Inconnue", "url": "https://www.3dbrew.org/wiki/Mode_Control_Services_PXI#\"pxi:mc\"_service", "note": "Stubbed, writes uninitialized stack byte to (u8*)(cmdbuf+4).", "depuis": "1.0.0-0"}
   ],
   "partiels": [
